#: model:ir.model.fields,help:approval_budget.field_approval_budget__executed_amount
msgid ""
"Amount executed. Record a positive amount if it is income and a negative "
"amount if it is a cost."
msgstr ""
"Importe ejecutado. Registre un importe positivo si se trata de un ingreso y "
"un importe negativo si se trata de un coste."

#. module: approval_budget
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:approval_budget.field_approval_budget__planned_amount
msgid ""
"Amount you plan to earn/spend. Record a positive amount if it is a revenue "
"and a negative amount if it is a cost."
msgstr ""
"Monto que planea ganar/gastar. Registre una monto positivo si se trata de un"
" ingreso y una monto negativo si se trata de un costo."

